        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add password_option subfeature to api.CredentialsContainer.create]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31122</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31122"/>
        <updated>2026-11-12T19:25:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91801467?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds the <code class="notranslate">password_option</code> subfeature under <code class="notranslate">api.CredentialsContainer.create</code> to reflect that passing a <code class="notranslate">password</code> option is not supported in Safari or Firefox.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Ran <code class="notranslate">npm run format</code>, <code class="notranslate">npm run lint</code>, and the repository unit test suite locally with all checks passing.</li>
<li>Safari unsupported status: <a href="https://webkit.org/b/252908" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/252908</a></li>
<li>Firefox unsupported status: <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1156047" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1156047</a></li>
<li>Note: Chrome <code class="notranslate">60</code> is inferred from <code class="notranslate">CredentialsContainer.create()</code> (Chrome 60) and <code class="notranslate">PasswordCredential</code> (Chrome 51) support rather than tested on a live Chrome 60 binary.</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #7941.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="769159969" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/7941" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/7941/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/7941">#7941</a></p>]]></content>
