    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Updates for Safari TP 256]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31058</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31058"/>
        <updated>2026-11-05T10:10:16.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">The <a href="https://collector.openwebdocs.org/" rel="nofollow">https://collector.openwebdocs.org/</a> project (v10.21.1) found new features shipping in Safari Technical Preview 255 on macOS 27 which was released yesterday. Currently, the collector covers about 90% of BCD, so the following list might not be exhaustive.</p>
<p dir="auto">Release notes: <a href="https://webkit.org/blog/18602/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-256/" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/blog/18602/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-256/</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Updated keys:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>api.CanvasRenderingContext2D.fontKerning</li>
<li>api.CanvasRenderingContext2D.fontStretch</li>
